# Performance

A comparison of **SVGPathCommander** with the [SvgPath](https://github.com/fontello/svgpath) library v2.6.0 and its [svg-path-bbox](https://github.com/fontello/svg-path-bbox) helper v2.1.0, run with `pnpm bench` against a sample path with `11650` path segments. All values are in **milliseconds**, reported as `avg / best` over 10 runs after 3 warmups; lower is better. The `vs svgpath` column is the `avg` ratio of SVGPathCommander to svgpath.

`transform2d` uses `{ scale: 0.8 }`, `transform3d` uses `{ rotate: [15, 15, 30] }`. [SvgPath](https://github.com/fontello/svgpath) only supports 2D transforms, so `transform3d` is marked `n/a` for it.

## Static methods

| Operation | SVGPathCommander (static) | svgpath | vs svgpath |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| parse | **7.4 / 7** | 9.7 / 9 | **0.8x** |
| bbox | **5.2 / 4** | 6.8 / 6 | **0.8x** |
| transform2d | 1.7 / 1 | 1.2 / 1 | 1.4x |
| transform3d | **14.3 / 11** | n/a | n/a |
| string | 6.2 / 5 | 5 / 5 | 1.2x |

## Instance methods

| Operation | SVGPathCommander (instance) | svgpath | vs svgpath |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| parse | **7.3 / 7** | 9.7 / 9 | **0.8x** |
| bbox | **5 / 4** | 6.8 / 6 | **0.7x** |
| transform2d | 1.3 / 0 | 1.2 / 1 | 1.1x |
| transform3d | **8.4 / 7** | n/a | n/a |
| string | 5.9 / 5 | 5 / 5 | 1.2x |

Last benchmark run on `2026-08-05`. Generated by [`scripts/bench.js`](scripts/bench.js); update with `pnpm bench`.
